iv>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"senseinvis\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sense Invis</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Behavioural Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"runsat\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Runs At</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(does not run)</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walksthrough\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Walks Through</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Energy Field (Square)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"19\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Energy_Field_Square_8987b7.gif\" width=\"18\"/></span></span> Energy<br/><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Fire\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"18\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Fire_0ff2ec.gif\" width=\"18\"/></span></span> Fire<br/><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Poison Gas\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"18\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Poison_Gas_c58dd6.gif\" width=\"18\"/></span></span> Poison</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">15.10.46b862<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">July 21, 2025<br/>Summer Update 2025</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: <a href=\"#/wiki/Creatures\">Creatures</a></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-item-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20250628082833&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Orclops_Bloodbreaker_227d2c.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"creature-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see an orclops bloodbreaker.</div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"><li>More ... blood!</li><li>Giiiive meee bloood!</li><li>Must ... crush ... bones!</li></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<div class=\"webdesc\"><blockquote class=\"webdesc-text\"><p>Where brute strength meets undying hunger, the Orcclops Bloodbreaker is born: an abomination forged in defiance of nature and sanity. These hulking cyclopean creatures were once part of the warbeast caste of orcish culture, bred for combat and conquest. Now, enhanced with the cursed gift of vampirism, they have become juggernauts of destruction. Their single eye, now blood-red and constantly weeping ichor, burns with ceaseless rage.\n</p><p>Their transformation was not without complications. Their bodies, already struggling to balance their mixed orc-cyclops heritage, twisted under the strain of undeath. Flesh split, bones swelled, and old scars reopened as they reawakened with newfound purpose and immeasurable pain. This agony is what drives them. It fuels their every strike, every roar, every bloody step forward.\nA Bloodbreaker is a nightmare on the battlefield. Their strength is matched only by their cruelty. With one massive blow, they can crush a grown man into pulp. With another, they can tear down fortified gates. They do not fight with tactics. They fight with hate.\n</p><p>\nThough initially hesitant, the Norcferatu master permitted their creation to offset the rebellion brewing among the dworcs. What he did not anticipate was how swiftly they would begin spreading the curse themselves, hungry for power and territory. Now, the Bloodbreakers roam, not as generals - but as living sieges, destroying anything in their path.</p></blockquote>\n<div class=\"webdesc-from\" style=\"float: right; margin: 0 2em 0 0;\">—Tibia Library</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-center wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\" data-seq-no=\"0\" hash=\"4312576280fe2ac417ea99da9a9e785b\" id=\"w-gallery-0\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Orclops_Bloodbreaker_Artwork-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:185px; width:152px;\"><img alt=\"Official Creature Artwork\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"Official \" height=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Orclops_Bloodbreaker_Artwork_ed0f2e.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"Orclops Bloodbreaker Artwork.jpg (478 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Official Creature Artwork</div></div></div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-abilities\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Abilities\">Abilities</span></h3>\n<div class=\"ability_list\">Unknown.</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mobile-hide\" id=\"w-creature-resistance-table\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Damage_Taken_From_Elements\">Dam